						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Friday, June 15, 2001</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Titanis & Samae  </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Titanis Promethean and Samae Moondance will be getting married on June 30,2001 at 4:00pm EST at the Lost City in Dreadlands.   
							<br>
							 - TITANIS<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=148">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							&nbsp;<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=148">[View Comments]</a>



					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Wednesday, May 30, 2001</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Prysenius's Marriage! </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Prysenius and Diison are having a marriage finally. They have been cybering for a long time and it is about time they tied to knot
							<br>
							 - Luvana<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=147">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							&nbsp;<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=147">[View Comments]</a>



					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Wednesday, May 23, 2001</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Might Of Norrath Will Be Changing Home Page's </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							The Current Home Page Is Still Up , But We Are Currently Under A Guild Merge : This Is The Current Page : http://communities.msn.com/mightofnorrath The New One Isn't Completed Yet , New Guild Name Will Be Order Of Honor !!!
							<br>
							 - InstigatorDrizz<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=146">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
<TR><TD><BR><img src=images/redline.gif height=2 width="100%"><BR><BR></TD></TR>
					

						<TR><TD><p class="pTitle">Thumper V2 in USB! </p></TD></TR>
							<TR><TD><p class=pText>
							The Thumper V2 Automatic Mouse Clicker is now available in USB and PS/2.  Experience the ultimate AFK mouse and enhance your skills and spellcasting with ease!
							<br>
							 - GM Associates<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=145">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Saturday, May 12, 2001</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Festival Of Light </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Greetings Norrath, <br><br>
	
	The Lightbringers of Ro will be hosting the first annual Festival Of Light on the Solusek Ro server.  The party will take place at the West Freeport Arena on Sunday, 5/13/01 at 8pmEST/5pmPST.  Everyone is welcome to join in on this festival of fighting, food, drinks, and friends!  We will be passing out free food and drinks for those who want some.  We also will be hosting a fight for all levels and classes, the winner of each fight will win prizes or money, so grab your swords and your spell books and come on down and join the fun!  We are also looking to recruit some of those who show up to this event, if your interested and are level 6 or above send a officer a /tell.  Please check out our web site for more info on this event: <br>www.angelfire.com/games3/lightbringersofro
<br><br>
Thanks,<br>
Lord Lenk<br>

							<br>
							 - Mijit<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=144">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Friday, May 11, 2001</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Caster's Day </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Saturday May 19th
6PM-10PM CST
In East Commonlands

I'm setting up an event for all researching caster classes to get together and share pages, words, runes, Etc to get past and upcomming spells researched.

Balandar Balefire
Blades of Light
Wizard of the 53rd Parallel
							<br>
							 - Balandar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=143">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Thursday, May 10, 2001</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Clan Donald - Noble Dreams </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Clan Donald recently changed to Noble Dreams.

Clan Donald had enjoyed over 2 years of great fun and was one of the last remaining original 10 guilds on Solusek Ro.
Anyone wondering about where Clan Donald went to, look up Noble Dreams.

It was a great run, and a fantastic group of people.  

Wish everyone the best.
							<br>
							 - Quinten-Wolfe<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=142">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Tuesday, May 08, 2001</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Casters Day </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Saturday May 19th
6PM-10PM CST
E Commons by tunnel

a get together for anyone to share words, pages, runes, etc to gain the spells you are missing and to help others gain theirs. Higher lvl's are apreciated to help research spells to lessen fails. I personally have a 190 research and can do any Wizard spell

Balandar Balefire
Blades of Light
Wizard of the 53rd parallel
							<br>
							 - Balandar Balefire<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=141">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Friday, April 20, 2001</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Huzzah and Bravo </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Night Raiders, lvl 1 - 20
Nomad lvl 20 - 50 are pleased to announce their Uber guild Apex will soon be formed to continued the Norrath tradition of assistence and kindness on a higher level.
							<br>
							 - Elizah<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=140">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
