					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Friday, April 13, 2001</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Solusek Message Boards!! </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Sorry everyone... I'd have thought someone would have sent this to you by now...

www.solusekro.org went down when Northpoint Communictions closed up shop.

They are currently up at:
http://209.202.194.157

Unfortuately they are having problems getting the DNS straightened out... but if you go to the above IP address you can connect right in...

None of the messages/boards were lost!

Hope to be back to normal soon.


(Just relaying this info... I'm not directly involved in the running of the board... Just one of the moderators)

Zerion Silverthorn
							<br>
							 - Zerion Silverthorn<BR><BR>
							</p>
